function fmtDate(s){ if(!s) return '—'; const d=new Date(s); if(isNaN(d)) return esc(s); return d.toLocaleString('pt-BR',{day:'2-digit',month:'long',year:'numeric',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'}); }
function codeFor(kind,i){ return ({hipotese:'H',falha:'H',fatores:'H',fator_sub:'H',contrib:'CC',raiz:'CR',acao:'A'}[kind]||'N')+(i+1); }
function hypothesisAncestors(id){
  const res=[]; let cur=id, guard=0;
  while(guard++<50){ const pe=state.tree.edges.find(e=>e.target===cur); if(!pe) break; const p=node(pe.source); if(!p) break; if(kindOf(p.kind).faixa==='hipoteses') res.push(p.label); cur=pe.source; }
  return res;
}
function rootLinkOptions(selected){
  const chosen=Array.isArray(selected)?selected:(selected?[selected]:[]);
  return byFaixa('raiz').map((r,i)=>`<option value="${r.id}" ${chosen.includes(r.id)?'selected':''}>CR${i+1} — ${esc(trunc(r.label,42))}</option>`).join('');
}
function parentRootCode(id){
  const action=node(id), raizes=byFaixa('raiz');
  const manuais=actionRootIds(action||{}).map(id=>raizes.findIndex(r=>r.id===id)).filter(i=>i>=0).map(i=>'CR'+(i+1)); if(manuais.length) return manuais.join(', ');
  let cur=id, guard=0;
  while(guard++<50){ const pe=state.tree.edges.find(e=>e.target===cur); if(!pe) break; const p=node(pe.source); if(!p) break; if(p.kind==='raiz'){ const idx=raizes.indexOf(p); return 'CR'+(idx+1); } cur=pe.source; }
  return '—';
}
function renderWhyReportHTML(){const active=state.whys.filter(w=>w.status!=='archived');if(!active.length)return '';const linked=active.filter(w=>w.link?.mode==='tree'),independent=active.filter(w=>w.link?.mode!=='tree');function section(title,list){if(!list.length)return '';return '<h3>'+title+'</h3>'+list.map(w=>{const ln=w.link?.mode==='tree'?node(w.link.nodeId):null;const steps=(w.steps||[]).filter(s=>s.question?.trim()||s.answer?.trim());return '<div style="border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;margin:8px 0"><b>'+esc(w.code+' • '+w.title)+'</b><div style="font-size:11px;margin-top:3px"><b>Estado:</b> '+esc(whyStatusLabel(w.status))+' · <b>Modo:</b> '+(ln?esc('Vinculada a '+nodeCode(ln)+' • '+ln.label):'Independente')+'</div><p style="font-size:11px"><b>Problema inicial:</b> '+esc(w.problem||'—')+'</p>'+(steps.length?'<table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Por quê?</th><th>Resposta</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+steps.map((st,i)=>'<tr><td>'+(i+1)+'</td><td>'+esc(st.question||'—')+'</td><td>'+esc(st.answer||'—')+'</td></tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>':'')+'<p style="font-size:11px"><b>Conclusão:</b> '+esc(w.conclusion||'—')+'<br><b>Resultado causal:</b> '+esc(w.causalResult||'—')+'</p></div>';}).join('');}return section('5 Porquês vinculados à Árvore de Causa',linked)+section('5 Porquês independentes',independent);}
